{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-jsx","path":"/인프라 구조 설계, 간단한 API 서버 이미지 빌드/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Wonyu"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"c6ece453-4a6b-5c41-800d-aa6e88b6490f","excerpt":"인프라 구조 계획한 구조는 다음과 같다.\n code push Git 레포지토리에 애플리케이션 코드를 푸시하는 단계로 이는 CI/CD 파이프라인의 시작점이다. push image GitHub Actions이 애플리케이션 코드를 Docker 이미지로 빌드하고, Amazon ECR(AWS Elastic Container Registry)에 이미지를 푸시하는 단…","html":"<h2 id=\"인프라-구조\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%9D%B8%ED%94%84%EB%9D%BC-%EA%B5%AC%EC%A1%B0\" aria-label=\"인프라 구조 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>인프라 구조</h2>\n<p>계획한 구조는 다음과 같다.\n<figure class='gatsby-resp-image-figure' style='margin-bottom: 16px;'>\n    <span class='gatsby-resp-image-wrapper' style='position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 680px; '>\n      <a class='gatsby-resp-image-link' href='/static/ee97b3a0cfa8f7f05cf094202683e0db/2573e/elastic-beanstalk-architecture.png' style='display: block' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>\n    <span class='gatsby-resp-image-background-image' style=\"padding-bottom: 57.64705882352942%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <img class='gatsby-resp-image-image' alt='architecture' title='' src='/static/ee97b3a0cfa8f7f05cf094202683e0db/ca1dc/elastic-beanstalk-architecture.png' srcset='/static/ee97b3a0cfa8f7f05cf094202683e0db/e7570/elastic-beanstalk-architecture.png 170w,\n/static/ee97b3a0cfa8f7f05cf094202683e0db/f46e7/elastic-beanstalk-architecture.png 340w,\n/static/ee97b3a0cfa8f7f05cf094202683e0db/ca1dc/elastic-beanstalk-architecture.png 680w,\n/static/ee97b3a0cfa8f7f05cf094202683e0db/02d09/elastic-beanstalk-architecture.png 1020w,\n/static/ee97b3a0cfa8f7f05cf094202683e0db/9d567/elastic-beanstalk-architecture.png 1360w,\n/static/ee97b3a0cfa8f7f05cf094202683e0db/2573e/elastic-beanstalk-architecture.png 1380w' sizes='(max-width: 680px) 100vw, 680px' style='width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;' loading='lazy' decoding='async'>\n  </a>\n    </span>\n    <figcaption class='gatsby-resp-image-figcaption'>architecture</figcaption>\n  </figure></p>\n<h3 id=\"code-push\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#code-push\" aria-label=\"code push permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>code push</h3>\n<p><strong>Git 레포지토리</strong>에 애플리케이션 코드를 푸시하는 단계로 이는 CI/CD 파이프라인의 시작점이다.</p>\n<h3 id=\"push-image\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#push-image\" aria-label=\"push image permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>push image</h3>\n<p>GitHub Actions이 애플리케이션 코드를 Docker 이미지로 빌드하고, Amazon ECR(AWS Elastic Container Registry)에 이미지를 푸시하는 단계다.</p>\n<h3 id=\"deploy\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#deploy\" aria-label=\"deploy permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>deploy</h3>\n<p>push된 새로운 버전의 이미지를 배포하는 단계다. 이때 업데이트는 롤링 업데이트 방식을 사용할 예정이다. 그 이유는 가장 무중단 배포 방식이기 때문이다.</p>\n<p>현재 팀에선 <strong>비용과 시간을 최대한 가볍게 가져가는 것이 중요</strong>하기 때문에 위 CI/CD 단계는 최대한 간단하게 Github Actions를 이용할 예정이다.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"간단한-API-서버-구축\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EA%B0%84%EB%8B%A8%ED%95%9C-API-%EC%84%9C%EB%B2%84-%EA%B5%AC%EC%B6%95\" aria-label=\"간단한 API 서버 구축 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>간단한 API 서버 구축</h2>\n<p><em>Member.java</em></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"java\"><pre class=\"language-java\"><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Entity</span>  \n<span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@NoArgsConstructor</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>access <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token class-name\"><span class=\"token namespace\">lombok<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span></span>AccessLevel</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token constant\">PROTECTED</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>  \n<span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Getter</span>  \n<span class=\"token keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Member</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>  \n  \n    <span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Id</span>  \n    <span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@GeneratedValue</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>strategy <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">GenerationType</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token constant\">IDENTITY</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>  \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">private</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Long</span> id<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>  \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">private</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">String</span> name<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>  \n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><em>MemberController.java</em></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"java\"><pre class=\"language-java\"><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@RestController</span>  \n<span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@RequiredArgsConstructor</span>  \n<span class=\"token keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">MemberController</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>  \n  \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">private</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">final</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">MemberRepository</span> memberRepository<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>  \n  \n    <span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@GetMapping</span>  \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">List</span><span class=\"token generics\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token class-name\">MemberDto</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span> <span class=\"token function\">test</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>  \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> memberRepository<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">findAll</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>  \n                               <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">stream</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>  \n                               <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">map</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token class-name\">MemberDto</span><span class=\"token operator\">::</span><span class=\"token function\">toDto</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>  \n                               <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">toList</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>  \n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>  \n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><em>MemberDto.java</em></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"java\"><pre class=\"language-java\"><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"token keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">record</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">MemberDto</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token class-name\">String</span> name<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>  \n  \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">static</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">MemberDto</span> <span class=\"token function\">toDto</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token keyword\">final</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Member</span> member<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>  \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">MemberDto</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>member<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">getName</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>  \n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>  \n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><em>MemberRepository.java</em></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"java\"><pre class=\"language-java\"><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"token keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">interface</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">MemberRepository</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">extends</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">JpaRepository</span><span class=\"token generics\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token class-name\">Member</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Long</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>  \n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>RDS 연결을 위해 다소 억지스러울 수 있는 API 서버를 구축했다.\n요청을 보내면, DB에 저장된 member의 데이터를 반환하는 API를 제공한다.</p>\n<p>이제 API 서버를 image로 빌드할 dockerfile을 작성해보자.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"dockerfile\"><pre class=\"language-dockerfile\"><code class=\"language-dockerfile\"><span class=\"token instruction\"><span class=\"token keyword\">FROM</span> gradle:7.6.1-jdk17 <span class=\"token keyword\">AS</span> build  </span>\n<span class=\"token instruction\"><span class=\"token keyword\">WORKDIR</span> /app  </span>\n<span class=\"token instruction\"><span class=\"token keyword\">COPY</span> build.gradle settings.gradle ./  </span>\n<span class=\"token instruction\"><span class=\"token keyword\">RUN</span> gradle dependencies --no-daemon  </span>\n<span class=\"token instruction\"><span class=\"token keyword\">COPY</span> . /app  </span>\n<span class=\"token instruction\"><span class=\"token keyword\">RUN</span> gradle clean build --no-daemon  </span>\n  \n<span class=\"token instruction\"><span class=\"token keyword\">FROM</span> openjdk:17-slim  </span>\n<span class=\"token instruction\"><span class=\"token keyword\">WORKDIR</span> /app  </span>\n<span class=\"token instruction\"><span class=\"token keyword\">COPY</span> <span class=\"token options\"><span class=\"token property\">--from</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">build</span></span> /app/build/libs/*.jar /app/app.jar  </span>\n<span class=\"token instruction\"><span class=\"token keyword\">EXPOSE</span> 8080  </span>\n<span class=\"token instruction\"><span class=\"token keyword\">ENTRYPOINT</span> [<span class=\"token string\">\"java\"</span>]  </span>\n<span class=\"token instruction\"><span class=\"token keyword\">CMD</span> [<span class=\"token string\">\"-jar\"</span>, <span class=\"token string\">\"app.jar\"</span>]</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>위처럼 멀티 스테이지 빌드를 사용하면, docker image 크기를 줄임으로써 배포 환경에서 보다 가볍고 빠르게 서버가 구동될 수 있다.</p>\n<p>위 Dockerfile을 이용하면, 만든 spring boot application을 이미지로 빌드할 수 있다.</p>","frontmatter":{"title":"인프라 구조 설계, 간단한 API 서버 이미지 빌드","date":"December 06, 2024","update":"December 06, 2024","tags":["aws"],"series":"Elastic Beanstalk로 Spring Boot Application CI/CD 구축"},"fields":{"slug":"/인프라 구조 설계, 간단한 API 서버 이미지 빌드/","readingTime":{"minutes":2.395}}},"seriesList":{"edges":[{"node":{"id":"e1fe1e10-fe59-5430-a1fd-41f3d87a6b0f","fields":{"slug":"/Elastic Beanstalk이란/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Elastic Beanstalk이란"}}},{"node":{"id":"c6ece453-4a6b-5c41-800d-aa6e88b6490f","fields":{"slug":"/인프라 구조 설계, 간단한 API 서버 이미지 빌드/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"인프라 구조 설계, 간단한 API 서버 이미지 빌드"}}},{"node":{"id":"6bef674f-1c82-504b-9961-6c545f84b2b9","fields":{"slug":"/Spring Boot Application Image ECR에 push(CI)/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Spring Boot Application Image ECR에 push(CI)"}}},{"node":{"id":"3aa5f43b-2e5f-5042-a259-dbac2763aea9","fields":{"slug":"/Elastic Beanstalk에 애플리케이션 배포, 자동화(CD)/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Elastic Beanstalk에 애플리케이션 배포, 자동화(CD)"}}}]},"previous":{"fields":{"slug":"/Elastic Beanstalk이란/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Elastic Beanstalk이란"}},"next":{"fields":{"slug":"/Spring Boot Application Image ECR에 push(CI)/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Spring Boot Application Image ECR에 push(CI)"}}},"pageContext":{"id":"c6ece453-4a6b-5c41-800d-aa6e88b6490f","series":"Elastic Beanstalk로 Spring Boot Application CI/CD 구축","previousPostId":"e1fe1e10-fe59-5430-a1fd-41f3d87a6b0f","nextPostId":"6bef674f-1c82-504b-9961-6c545f84b2b9"}},"staticQueryHashes":[],"slicesMap":{}}